From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oxwen11 <iamoxwen@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:35:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] terminal: add Grid, drawing cells another emulator keeps

Grid reuses View's row cache, shaping, drawn characters, cursor,
selection and preedit for cells its owner resolves, without a
Terminal or libghostty. buildRow's per-cell work moves into a
rowBuilder both share, and the cell metrics into fontKey.cell, which
CellSize exposes. View's behavior is unchanged.
